{"query": "Fortinet Inc incorporated 2000 date SEC founded 2000 official", "follow_up_questions": null, "answer": null, "images": [], "results": [{"title": "Fortinet - Wikipedia", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet", "score": 0.685971, "raw_content": "[Jump to content](#bodyContent)\n\n[![](/static/images/icons/enwiki-25.svg)  ![Wikipedia](/static/images/mobile/copyright/wikipedia-wordmark-en-25.svg) ![The Free Encyclopedia](/static/images/mobile/copyright/wikipedia-tagline-en-25.svg)](/wiki/Main_Page)\n\n[Search](/wiki/Special:Search \"Search Wikipedia [f]\")\n\n## Contents\n\n* [1 History](#History)\n  + [1.1 Early history](#Early_history)\n  + [1.2 Growth and expansion](#Growth_and_expansion)\n  + [1.3 Recent history](#Recent_history)\n* [2 Acquisitions](#Acquisitions)\n* [3 Products and research](#Products_and_research)\n  + [3.1 Products](#Products)\n  + [3.2 Vulnerabilities and credential leaks](#Vulnerabilities_and_credential_leaks)\n  + [3.3 Cybersecurity research](#Cybersecurity_research)\n* [4 Controversies](#Controversies)\n* [5 References](#References)\n* [6 Further reading](#Further_reading)\n* [7 External links](#External_links)\n\n# Fortinet\n\n* [العربية](https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%81%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%AA%D9%8A%D9%86%D8%AA \"فورتينت – Arabic\")\n* [বাংলা](https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%AB%E0%A7%8B%E0%A6%B0%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%9F%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%A8%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%9F \"ফোর্টিনেট – Bangla\")\n* [Dansk](https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"Fortinet – Danish\")\n* [Deutsch](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"Fortinet – German\")\n* [Español](https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"Fortinet – Spanish\")\n* [فارسی](https://fa.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%81%D9%88%D8%B1%D8%AA%DB%8C%E2%80%8C%D9%86%D8%AA \"فورتی‌نت – Persian\")\n* [Français](https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"Fortinet – French\")\n* [עברית](https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"Fortinet – Hebrew\")\n* [Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fortinet \"For